371	/// <summary>
372	/// Resolve the upstream client IP for rate-limit partitioning. Reads from
373	/// <c>Connection.RemoteIpAddress</c>, which the ForwardedHeaders middleware
374	/// (configured upstream of <c>UseRateLimiter</c>) has already populated with
