**Why this shape:** a button template is capped at **3 buttons and one message** with no follow-up routing, so you can't ask language first and branch. The workable move is bilingual text + the three actions (Pricing, Group, Private), each a direct link.

**Watch the 20-character button limit** — the titles above are within it, but if Meta trims them, shorten to e.g. `💰 Pricing`, `🧘 Group class`, `👤 Private class` (English-only).

