Want me to add **UTM tracking** to the six links so Messenger-driven bookings show up tagged in your analytics?

A single Send-API message can carry **both** an attachment (buttons) and quick replies, so here it is as one JSON — quick-reply language chips on top, the three action buttons below:

```json
{
